<title>NETHERLANDS: Moeara, Dordtsche declare divs.</title>
<headline>Moeara, Dordtsche declare divs.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>NV Petroleum Maatschappij Moeara Enim said it would pay a second 1996 interim dividend per ordinary share of 42.20 guilders. Dordtsche Petroleum-Industrie Maatschappij NV said it would pay a second 1996 interim dividend per ordinary share of 4.32 guilders.</p>
<p>Both Moeara Enim and Dordtsche are investment companies which only hold shares in Royal Dutch Petroleum Co.</p>
<p>Earlier today Royal Dutch said it would pay a 1996 interim dividend of 4.30 guilders per share, versus a 1995 interim of 3.90 guilders. Royal Dutch owns 60 percent of the Royal Dutch/Shell oil group.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
